  "disposition": "EXACT_ARCHIVE_ONLY_WHOLE_MANIFEST_METADATA_WITH_GENUINE_COUNT_EQUATIONS_AND_PROOFS",
  "review_notes": [
    "Each1702B original and3287B organized source read separately in full. All six manifest/reference records, two default fields, the actual conjunction predicate and both projection proofs are accounted.",
